### $ swytchcode login --help
Log in to your Swytchcode account via device-flow OAuth:
  swytchcode login

To connect a provider, use 'swytchcode auth connect <provider>' instead.
Use --open to have the CLI open the OAuth URL in your browser automatically.

Usage:
  swytchcode login [flags]

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for login
      --open   Open the login URL in your browser automatically
[exit 0]
